Package: pve-klp
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: mokutil
Description: kernel livepatch agent for Proxmox VE hosts
 Fetches the signed livepatch manifest for exactly the running Proxmox VE
 kernel, verifies signature, kernel release, build-id and module hash, loads
 the module and watches the livepatch transition. A stalled transition is
 reversed instead of forced; a patch that misbehaves afterwards is backed out
 and the previous level restored.
 .
 A livepatch bridges the time until the next maintenance window. It does not
 replace installing the kernel update and rebooting.
